{"3325570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kaodi", "steam_appid": 3325570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3688280], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/e1f381c2947fa05886c7430c97f795d9.poster.avif?t=1788285530\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/e1f381c2947fa05886c7430c97f795d9.webm?t=1788285530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/e1f381c2947fa05886c7430c97f795d9.mp4?t=1788285530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/19fc9575a03a4eae7e3b6c8cac8d9221.avif?t=1788285530\" width=750 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kaodi</i> is a brief tale about the scars that war leaves on both the world and the heart. After playing a pivotal role in the victory over the Republic of Shan, Barren must journey home on a path laden with guilt, trauma, doubts, broken friendships, and fractured loyalties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a wide array of characters, each offering a fresh perspective on the devastation of war: stories of loss, dignity, forgiveness…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience is enriched by a beautiful art style, blending traditional pixel art with 3D modeling techniques and effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/8e6c38e9c4044dd5c48c518de083eebf.avif?t=1788285530\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras_big/8e6c38e9c4044dd5c48c518de083eebf.avif?t=1788285530 width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the <i>Inner World</i>, you’ll navigate Barren's deepest thoughts. Reflect on them or interact with other NPCs to uncover powerful testimonies, complete small quests, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/21228959d9cc108f667c3ad9ee6bf4c6.poster.avif?t=1788285530\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/21228959d9cc108f667c3ad9ee6bf4c6.webm?t=1788285530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/21228959d9cc108f667c3ad9ee6bf4c6.mp4?t=1788285530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/6f9ee12cd3a0404681acdfe3cc6c3b3a.avif?t=1788285530\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras_big/6f9ee12cd3a0404681acdfe3cc6c3b3a.avif?t=1788285530 width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though the war is over, Barren will be forced to duel his way through certain areas. Use his movement and combat abilities to defeat opponents and overcome obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/7cf6663c733b26763e62059ff7ea06e0.poster.avif?t=1788285530\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/7cf6663c733b26763e62059ff7ea06e0.webm?t=1788285530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/7cf6663c733b26763e62059ff7ea06e0.mp4?t=1788285530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/19fc9575a03a4eae7e3b6c8cac8d9221.avif?t=1788285530\" width=750 height=122 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/e1f381c2947fa05886c7430c97f795d9.poster.avif?t=1788285530\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/e1f381c2947fa05886c7430c97f795d9.webm?t=1788285530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/e1f381c2947fa05886c7430c97f795d9.mp4?t=1788285530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/19fc9575a03a4eae7e3b6c8cac8d9221.avif?t=1788285530\" width=750 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kaodi</i> is a brief tale about the scars that war leaves on both the world and the heart. After playing a pivotal role in the victory over the Republic of Shan, Barren must journey home on a path laden with guilt, trauma, doubts, broken friendships, and fractured loyalties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a wide array of characters, each offering a fresh perspective on the devastation of war: stories of loss, dignity, forgiveness…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience is enriched by a beautiful art style, blending traditional pixel art with 3D modeling techniques and effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/8e6c38e9c4044dd5c48c518de083eebf.avif?t=1788285530\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras_big/8e6c38e9c4044dd5c48c518de083eebf.avif?t=1788285530 width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the <i>Inner World</i>, you’ll navigate Barren's deepest thoughts. Reflect on them or interact with other NPCs to uncover powerful testimonies, complete small quests, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/21228959d9cc108f667c3ad9ee6bf4c6.poster.avif?t=1788285530\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/21228959d9cc108f667c3ad9ee6bf4c6.webm?t=1788285530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/21228959d9cc108f667c3ad9ee6bf4c6.mp4?t=1788285530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras/6f9ee12cd3a0404681acdfe3cc6c3b3a.avif?t=1788285530\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325570/extras_big/6f9ee12cd3a0404681acdfe3cc6c3